# Polynomial multiplication of 5 coefficients by 5, over GF(2).
# Slice i is the matrix of the bilinear form producing output coefficient c_i,
# so slice i has a 1 at (j,k) exactly when j+k == i. Naive rank is 5*5 = 25.
